The stage-breakdown instrumentation for vsc's crypto code: the `timed(Category::...)`
wrappers on the outer, sequential call sites (the reverse of their removal in
2ad569ecae). Never applied on the branch; bench-ec2/remote-bench.sh applies it to a
scratch copy of the tip with `patch -p1` when BREAKDOWN=1 and builds that copy with
`--features profile`. If it stops applying, regenerate it from the per-site audit in
PERFORMANCE.md (Constraints); the sites are the ones the audit lists.

